From 13fe2e36c38c585a388e8884603ae98717572a8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch-author <a@a.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 06:56:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0375: Wisplet path fix, Flying Eye obtainable, doc
 correction

- tools/import_pets.py: WISPLET's anim_files path corrected from
  "Whisp/NoobGodoter'sSpritesheet.png" to 'FireSprite.png' -- the
  re-supplied pack is a flat file at --src's top level. Confirmed by
  measuring the real file (2880x288, 10 frames) against manifest.json's
  existing entry before assuming, then actually running the import.
- raid-encounters.json: loom_the_presiding_intelligence (Silence the
  Loom, reqLevel 43) now carries flying_eye's eggLoot/eggLootHeroic/
  eggLootLegendary, closing a real gap found during the dedicated-drops
  audit -- flying_eye was dedicatedOnly with no source anywhere,
  completely unobtainable. Rates match Rattles' own curve (similar-tier
  raid) rather than inventing a new one.
- guild-idler-status.md: corrected patch 0374's own guidance that the
  Ruby Dragonling sprite belongs under public/dlc/founders_pack/ --
  PetSprite.tsx is hardcoded to public/pets/ only, checked for real this
  time. Real consequence (art ships in every install regardless of DLC
  ownership) stated plainly, not glossed over.
- Verified: tsc --noEmit, vite build, electron-builder --linux dir
  package build, an actual import_pets.py run against the real Wisplet
  file, and the new eggLoot data confirmed loading through
  RAID_ENCOUNTER_BY_ID.
